    // The point of the pen is the edge of the stroke's mask: the mask is
    // 2.6 times the stroke's width, with its edge at the middle, and moves
    // from 100% to 0%, so the edge runs from -0.3 to 1.3 of the width.
    // While the pen is writing the coloured word, every little while the
    // letters just behind it give off an echo.
